// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2982655648" "Ready to cause some mayhem in Paragon City? <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Go to Founders Falls and hit one of the banks there.</A> Once you hit Founders Falls you'll have 15 minutes to rob the bank and escape.<br><br><color orange>Be careful! Freedom Phalanx, the Vindicators and WISDOM have been seen in the area, if you bring more than a few villains with you they might take notice!</color><br><br><color deepskyblue>This is a Mayhem Mission. You can earn extra time by destroying property and creating diversions away from the bank itself.<br><br>Each type of item rewards a single time bonus after you destroy a certain number of that item. For each person on your team, you will need to destroy more of that particular item to get the time bonus.<br><br>Five side missions can be found on this map. Keys (found by defeating certain enemies) are needed to unlock these side missions. Each completed side mission also rewards a time bonus.<br><br>Every character that is at least level 40 receives a special temporary power the first time they successfully complete this mission.</color>"
// AcceptString :
"P1537098766" "Rob Founders Falls bank"
// SendOffString :
"P2859158657" "Expect some resistance from Longbow.  They've been monitoring the activities of villains in the Rogue Isles for quite some time."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2556524894" "Go cause some mayhem!"
// DeclineString :
"P1500738584" "No thanks"
// DeclineSendOffString :
"P2362584480" "Suit yourself."

